+ constrained-content-size
    - size PSize
    - query MeasureQuery

PSize(width, height)

.. width = constrained-axis-size(size.width, query.inline, $min-width, $max-width)
.. height = constrained-axis-size(size.height, query.block, $min-height, $max-height)

────────────────────
+ do constrained-axis-size
    - size Coord
    - query AxisQuery
    - minimum SizeSpec
    - maximum SizeSpec

. result = size
. min-size = resolved-size-spec(query, minimum)
if min-size
    result = max(result, min-size)
. max-size = resolved-size-spec(query, maximum)
if max-size
    result = min(result, max-size)
= result

────────────────────
+ resolved-size-spec
    - query AxisQuery
    - spec SizeSpec

match? spec
    | SizeSpec.coord(value)
        value
    | SizeSpec.percent(percent)
        resolved-percent-size(percent, query)

────────────────────
+ do resolved-percent-size Coord?
    - percent Percent
    - query AxisQuery

if query.available
    = round((percent as Ratio) * query.available) as Coord

